02:12:41.730 --> 02:12:43.810
She'll tell us everything. I just

02:12:43.810 --> 02:12:46.320
know she will. Nonsense.

02:12:46.680 --> 02:12:48.560
Take that robot away. Do you hear

02:12:48.560 --> 02:12:50.340
me? Take that robot away.

02:12:50.920 --> 02:12:52.440
I don't have to put up with this.

02:12:52.580 --> 02:12:54.080
I've had enough. I'm leaving.

02:12:54.420 --> 02:12:56.460
Let's go home, Astro. Yes, let's

02:12:56.460 --> 02:12:59.040
go. Dr. Elephant, don't

02:12:59.040 --> 02:12:59.880
go. Please help.

02:13:00.000 --> 02:13:06.550
us. I'm Prince Siegfried. Evil things are happening here. Astro is right.

02:13:16.140 --> 02:13:23.720
The king himself. This will take you next.

02:13:36.140 --> 02:13:36.900
Ha ha ha ha ha!

02:13:39.080 --> 02:13:43.630
Drones, stop! Professor Hyde, I insist that you stop this immediately.

02:13:44.510 --> 02:13:45.430
Devil, stop.

02:13:45.470 --> 02:13:47.830
Winter Elephant, this monster kidnapped Princess Odette!

02:13:48.960 --> 02:13:51.140
Professor Hyde, is Astro telling the truth?

02:13:51.480 --> 02:13:53.960
I don't know what he's talking about.

02:13:54.200 --> 02:13:56.720
Well, then, what was it that you did to Prince Siegfried?

02:13:56.980 --> 02:13:58.080
Tell me, I want to know.

02:13:58.720 --> 02:13:59.980
It's all part of the game.

02:14:00.740 --> 02:14:03.000
Or shall we say the show?

02:14:03.320 --> 02:14:05.200
Now, don't take it so seriously.

02:14:05.920 --> 02:14:08.200
Come on, you have nothing to fear.

02:14:08.380 --> 02:14:10.300
You're acting like a child.

02:14:10.780 --> 02:14:13.700
Astro, let's go. I can't stay in this ridiculous place anymore.

02:14:13.760 --> 02:14:14.500
It's not funny.

02:14:31.790 --> 02:14:32.010
You

