Astro in trouble in robot land and all by himself, you say?

02:16:03.240 --> 02:16:05.620
Yes, and he must have been caught by Professor Hyden.

02:16:06.260 --> 02:16:07.060
Oh, no!

02:16:07.520 --> 02:16:09.480
I'm afraid so. I got a call this morning.

02:16:11.820 --> 02:16:16.420
It was you who sent Astro to my island, isn't it true, Dr. Elephant?

02:16:17.050 --> 02:16:18.060
Huh? Astro?

02:16:18.180 --> 02:16:20.900
Don't lie to me, Elephant. You never liked my robots.

02:16:21.060 --> 02:16:23.920
So you sent Astro to stir them up, turn them against me.

02:16:23.940 --> 02:16:24.940
I have done no such thing!

02:16:25.020 --> 02:16:26.940
That's all, Doctor. Goodbye for now.

02:16:28.660 --> 02:16:29.640
So that's how it is.

02:16:30.280 --> 02:16:32.460
Well, let's get over there right away.

02:16:32.780 --> 02:16:33.660
Thanks. I knew you'd help.

02:16:34.790 --> 02:16:36.270
Good. The teacher's gone.

02:16:36.570 --> 02:16:40.950
Jordan, he went to Robot Land without us, leaving us here to study on our own.

02:16:41.180 --> 02:16:43.280
He went to Robot Land to save Astro, I bet.

02:16:44.260 --> 02:16:45.360
I'm going to rescue him, too.

02:16:46.020 --> 02:16:47.540
Huh? Alvin, don't.

02:16:47.710 --> 02:16:49.030
Kenneth, I'll go get Alvin.

02:16:49.690 --> 02:16:52.970
Wait a minute, Alvin. Wait!

02:16:53.280 --> 02:16:55.000
Hey, Teddy, are you trying to stop me?

02:16:55.200 --> 02:16:57.560
No, no. I want to go with you, Alvin.

02:16:57.760 --> 02:16:59.220
Oh, all right. Let's go.

02:17:01.560 --> 02:17:05.530
Oh, no, you've got to take all of us. We're all in this together.

02:17:07.360 --> 02:17:11.000
Now, listen, surely you don't think Astro came here to wreck things, do you?

02:17:11.630 --> 02:17:14.550
Astro's a good boy in class. He wouldn't do such a thing.

02:17:15.210 --> 02:17:18.610
Good boy, my foot. How dare you let such a violent robot lose.

02:17:19.210 --> 02:17:22.310
You take that back. I'm not going to stand here and take this.

02:17:23.190 --> 02:17:24.810
I tell you, Astro's a good boy.

02:17:24.970 --> 02:17:27.290
Well, no wonder if his teacher's violent, too.

02:17:27.490 --> 02:17:28.250
Who are you?

02:17:28.670 --> 02:17:29.970
If you so much as lay a hand...

02:17:30.000 --> 02:17:31.220
on me, I'll call the police.

02:17:31.970 --> 02:17:34.590
Now, Professor Hyde, Daddy Walrus didn't mean

02:17:34.590 --> 02:17:35.630
anything, really.

02:17:35.890 --> 02:17:38.410
Dr. Elephant, you're the Minister of Science and also the

02:17:38.410 --> 02:17:40.050
Engineer responsible for Astro.

02:17:40.210 --> 02:17:42.530
He's broken the law by entering my robot land

02:17:42.530 --> 02:17:43.930
and wrecking the facilities here.

02:17:44.070 --> 02:17:45.970
I don't care who he is.

02:17:47.240 --> 02:17:49.200
Article 136 of the Robot Act.

02:17:49.320 --> 02:17:51.060
The robot is to be scrapped, and the man

02:17:51.060 --> 02:17:53.120
responsible for him will be punished, too.

02:17:53.540 --> 02:17:55.220
Now, if I report this to the

02:17:55.220 --> 02:17:57.140
authorities, Astro will be turned

02:17:57.140 --> 02:17:58.960
into a worthless pile of metal,

02:17:59.000 --> 02:17:59.900
and you'll lose your

02:17:59.900 --> 02:17:59.980
Here we go.

02:18:00.000 --> 02:18:00.940
position as minister.

02:18:05.130 --> 02:18:06.370
There's robot land.

02:18:06.550 --> 02:18:08.070
Aren't they going to spot us?

02:18:08.190 --> 02:18:10.190
I brought my skin-diving outfit with me.

02:18:10.390 --> 02:18:12.290
That's good thinking, Alvin.

02:18:14.230 --> 02:18:16.390
Please, Professor Hyde, I beg of you, please.

02:18:16.610 --> 02:18:18.710
I'll do anything in my power, please.

02:18:20.590 --> 02:18:21.790
Hmm, anything?

02:18:22.290 --> 02:18:24.610
Then you must destroy Astro.

02:18:24.650 --> 02:18:26.050
What? Destroy Astro?

02:18:26.370 --> 02:18:28.970
Yes, if you do that, I won't report you.

02:18:29.170 --> 02:18:29.970
You can keep...

02:18:30.000 --> 02:18:32.820
Keep your job as Minister of Science.

02:18:35.900 --> 02:18:37.180
You scoundrels!

02:18:39.580 --> 02:18:51.900
What the head is?

02:18:52.140 --> 02:18:52.780
Let's see.

02:18:54.720 --> 02:18:55.940
A secret escape hole.

02:19:03.000 --> 02:19:04.740
Looks like a submarine cargo boat.

02:19:05.160 --> 02:19:07.720
Maybe for carrying cargo to robot land.

02:19:08.560 --> 02:19:09.880
But why a submarine, then?

02:19:16.220 --> 02:19:17.220
Take a look inside.

02:19:20.870 --> 02:19:21.390
Missiles.

02:19:21.980 --> 02:19:23.280
So that's what they're making.

02:19:26.300 --> 02:19:27.080
What's that there?

02:19:30.320 --> 02:19:36.000
So this is what robot land's all about.

02:19:36.460 --> 02:19:38.480
The robots are made to produce weapons,

02:19:40.120 --> 02:19:42.540
and that submarine takes them to foreign countries.

02:19:42.900 --> 02:19:43.500
Let's go.

02:19:46.200 --> 02:19:46.300
Huh?

02:19:46.980 --> 02:19:48.620
Let me out! Let me out!

02:19:49.360 --> 02:19:53.660
Quiet! We'll let you out, only after we turn you into a little metal doll.

02:19:53.920 --> 02:19:54.780
Someone's being held prisoner.

02:19:55.000 --> 02:19:55.640
Astro, huh?

02:19:55.840 --> 02:19:57.080
I don't think so. Listen.

02:20:00.120 --> 02:20:01.620
Princess Odette is waiting for me.

02:20:01.800 --> 02:20:02.920
Let me out of this place.

02:20:02.960 --> 02:20:03.540
Shut up.

02:20:04.250 --> 02:20:04.950
Who's that?

02:20:08.690 --> 02:20:08.850
I.

02:20:11.720 --> 02:20:12.440
You, stop.

02:20:15.740 --> 02:20:19.740
Hurry, come out.

02:20:20.130 --> 02:20:20.550
Thanks.

02:20:20.940 --> 02:20:21.720
But who are you?

02:20:22.060 --> 02:20:23.580
We are all friends of Astro.

02:20:23.810 --> 02:20:26.270
Please hurry and take us to where he is.

02:20:27.980 --> 02:20:29.980
Well, Dr. Elephant, get on with...

