02:21:05.660 --> 02:21:07.120
A good guy, huh?

02:21:07.600 --> 02:21:08.800
All right, I'll shoot him.

02:21:09.260 --> 02:21:10.140
Give him that to me.

02:21:10.640 --> 02:21:11.040
Look.

02:21:12.240 --> 02:21:12.700
Huh?

02:21:14.440 --> 02:21:15.560
What are you kids doing?

02:21:15.960 --> 02:21:17.780
We've come to save Astro.

02:21:18.370 --> 02:21:21.410
Why, you fools, you're supposed to be at school now.

02:21:21.630 --> 02:21:22.810
Keep out of the way.

02:21:23.230 --> 02:21:25.410
Sir, we found something very important.

02:21:25.590 --> 02:21:26.830
You must come and see it.

02:21:26.970 --> 02:21:27.670
What's that you say?

02:21:29.070 --> 02:21:29.970
This island is...

02:21:30.000 --> 02:21:31.720
This is a secret weapons factory.

02:21:32.280 --> 02:21:34.480
Missiles and laser guns are being made.

02:21:35.320 --> 02:21:36.040
What's that?

02:21:36.480 --> 02:21:37.840
What's the meaning of this?

02:21:38.520 --> 02:21:40.300
So you've seen that, hmm?

02:21:40.960 --> 02:21:41.600
I see now.

02:21:41.800 --> 02:21:43.720
Yes, of course, of course I see it.

02:21:43.780 --> 02:21:46.000
This island might very well have cost a fortune.

02:21:46.240 --> 02:21:48.820
But by making weapons and selling them to the highest bidder,

02:21:48.940 --> 02:21:50.500
you could easily have paid for it all.

02:21:50.640 --> 02:21:52.060
Isn't that right, why, you?

02:21:52.560 --> 02:21:53.300
That's right.

02:21:55.060 --> 02:21:56.680
Now that you know, you die.

02:21:59.270 --> 02:21:59.970
I've been...

02:22:00.000 --> 02:22:05.080
waiting for this chance. Take this and that, you scoundrel!

02:22:05.650 --> 02:22:06.790
Devil King!

02:22:16.870 --> 02:22:19.880
Devil King, take them away and kill them!

02:22:20.540 --> 02:22:22.280
None of them will escape, Professor!

02:22:24.790 --> 02:22:29.420
Alright, let's rescue Astro!

02:22:31.340 --> 02:22:34.500
Darn those robots. Devil King, get them.

02:22:41.720 --> 02:22:44.040
Astro, there.

02:22:45.740 --> 02:22:46.400
Thanks a lot.

02:22:55.730 --> 02:22:56.830
I'm back for more.

02:24:00.190 --> 02:24:05.110
Oh, Devil, my precious Devil King.

02:24:06.670 --> 02:24:08.410
So what now, my robots?

02:24:08.670 --> 02:24:10.610
What are you going to do to me?

02:24:10.750 --> 02:24:11.890
We're not slaves.

02:24:12.130 --> 02:24:13.830
We refuse to obey you.

02:24:14.030 --> 02:24:15.810
Robot land belongs to me.

02:24:15.930 --> 02:24:16.350
We're free!

02:24:17.950 --> 02:24:20.290
You're my slaves, I tell you!

02:24:20.390 --> 02:24:25.030
Freedom! Freedom! Freedom! Freedom! Freedom! Freedom!

02:24:33.740 --> 02:24:36.700
Robotland has become a comfortable place to live.

02:24:37.060 --> 02:24:38.220
We're all doing well.

02:24:38.540 --> 02:24:41.160
Please visit us with your friends and family.

02:24:41.560 --> 02:24:44.020
Sincerely, Siegfried, Princess Odette.

02:24:44.910 --> 02:24:47.450
Yes, thank you, Odette. I will.

02:24:57.200 --> 02:24:59.980
Robot Vikings were a group of vandals that...

02:25:00.030 --> 02:25:02.010
the city at night, terrorizing people

02:25:02.010 --> 02:25:03.810
and destroying everything in sight.

02:25:04.070 --> 02:25:05.930
It looked like nothing could stop

02:25:05.930 --> 02:25:07.750
them, not even my watchdog jump.

02:25:08.400 --> 02:25:10.220
I couldn't get permission to go after them,

02:25:10.340 --> 02:25:11.840
so I disguised myself.

02:25:12.620 --> 02:25:14.240
Even then, my troubles weren't over,

02:25:14.320 --> 02:25:16.340
because I had to face their leader,

02:25:17.470 --> 02:25:19.470
Atlas. Tune in next time

02:25:19.470 --> 02:25:21.490
for the Robot Vikings, right here on

02:25:21.490 --> 02:25:22.230
Astro Boy.

02:26:00.280 --> 02:26:00.540
Enjoy!

02:26:49.390 --> 02:26:53.730
Vikings were a group of vandals that roamed the city at night, terrorizing people and

02:26:53.730 --> 02:26:59.010
destroying everything in sight. It looked like nothing could stop them, not even my watchdog

02:26:59.010 --> 02:26:59.270
jump.

02:27:00.000 --> 02:27:03.400
I couldn't get permission to go after them, so I disguised myself.

02:27:04.130 --> 02:27:09.320
Even then, my troubles weren't over because I had to face their leader, Atlas.

02:27:09.990 --> 02:27:13.730
Tune in next time for the Robot Vikings right here on Astro Boy.

02:27:20.240 --> 02:27:24.800
One day, there was a terrible rocket battle above my house, and one of the rockets was shot down.

02:27:26.440 --> 02:27:29.980
It was Livian escaping from Atlas to warn me that I would soon...

02:27:30.000 --> 02:27:35.800
have to face my old enemy again. This time he was using a powerful beam to melt the ice

02:27:35.800 --> 02:27:41.020
at the North Pole and causing terrible flooding all over the world. It turned out to be the

02:27:41.020 --> 02:27:45.980
most desperate battle we've ever had. Tune in next time for the Great Meltdown.

02:28:00.570 --> 02:28:05.790
Lots of people find notes in bottles, but one day I found 43 of them.

02:28:06.100 --> 02:28:11.880
All from a girl named Lily, who was being held with her father on a strange island named Pellegros.

02:28:12.240 --> 02:28:17.940
I wasn't supposed to leave the house at night, much less the country, but I decided I had to look for her.

02:28:18.220 --> 02:28:22.320
My first trip didn't give me any answers, only more baffling questions.

02:28:22.860 --> 02:28:26.260
Tune in next time as I look for Lily on Pellegros Island.

02:28:30.640 --> 02:28:35.360
When it snowed in late summer, there had to be something wrong, and there was.

02:28:35.800 --> 02:28:40.540
The snow fed on energy, and it came from a strange leopard way up in the sky.

02:28:41.020 --> 02:28:44.400
Not even a powerful rocket could break through the snow.

02:28:44.820 --> 02:28:48.160
It seemed hopeless, until I had a crazy idea.

02:28:48.530 --> 02:28:50.710
Fight the leopard at its own game.

02:28:51.070 --> 02:28:54.830
Tune in next time for The Snow Leopard, here on Astro Boy.

02:28:55.010 --> 02:28:55.510
So long.

02:29:02.880 --> 02:29:06.360
Above the village of River Valley, there was a rock with the face of a man.

02:29:06.850 --> 02:29:10.770
When Daddy Walrus took us to see it, he told us a legend about the rock.

02:29:11.170 --> 02:29:14.470
When it turned its face toward the lake, the village would be destroyed.

02:29:15.050 --> 02:29:18.310
Nothing could make that rock move, except people up to no good.

02:29:18.530 --> 02:29:22.050
The rock began to tremble and finally fell.

02:29:22.440 --> 02:29:24.320
Could I hold on long enough?

02:29:24.830 --> 02:29:28.190
Find out next time in The Human-Faced Rock, here on Astro Boy.

02:29:36.720 --> 02:29:40.140
Yoraine refused to act as ladylike as Mom and Dad thought she should.

02:29:40.440 --> 02:29:43.340
They wanted her to play the piano and study her lessons.

02:29:43.680 --> 02:29:46.480
But Yoraine wished she could become two robots

02:29:46.480 --> 02:29:47.960
so one could obey her parents

02:29:47.960 --> 02:29:51.040
and the other could go to see the robot wrestling matches.

02:29:51.520 --> 02:29:54.300
It sounds impossible, but she got her wish

02:29:54.300 --> 02:29:56.920
and before long she wasn't just watching the matches

02:29:56.920 --> 02:29:58.860
but fighting in them, too.

02:30:00.570 --> 02:30:02.050
Until next time on Astro Boy!
